{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"La Sonate des spectres","Juliette, petite fille de Gisèle Casadesus et Lucien Pascal, est enceinte. Elle désire une trace cinématographique de ses grands-parents qu’elle admire. Elle demande à Ivan de mettre en scène La Sonate des Spectres dans la maison de retraite de Lucien en plein quartier Pigalle. Dans cette pièce fantastique de Strindberg, Lucien Pascal joue le rôle d'un homme très riche, commanditaire du meurtre d'une mystérieuse laitière. Ivan tient le rôle du jeune homme dont le père a exécuté le meurtre, et qui par la suite s'est donné la mort. Une étrange amitié lie les personnages de Lucien et d'Ivan, comme une filiation perverse...",[4,5,6,7,8],"grandparenthood","retirement","retirement home","disability","artistic creation",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":28,"media":30,"synopsis":33,"production":34,"characters":37,"roles":38,"awards":57,"tags":3},"Film","FR2015_016","fr2015-016-la-sonate-des-spectres",{"native":1,"english":14},"",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2015-01-21",2015,"Fiction film",[21],{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":27},"Ivan Heidsieck","ivan-heidsieck",0,"Male identifying","France",[],[29],"Documentary – Reflexive mode",{"posterUrl":31,"trailerUrl":32},"https://fr.web.img3.acsta.net/c_310_420/pictures/14/12/22/15/24/070039.jpg","https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x2ew7pc",{"native":2,"english":14},[35],{"country":26,"share":36},"Majority coproducer",[],[39,47,51],{"person":40,"role":46},{"id":41,"slug":42,"name":41,"birthYear":43,"deathYear":24,"gender":44,"nationality":26,"awards":45},"Gisèle Casadesus","gisele-casadesus",1914,"Female identifying",[],"Documentary subject",{"person":48,"role":50},{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":24,"gender":25,"nationality":26,"awards":49},[],"Dire